WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.436 --> 00:00:03.053
Lesson fourteen. Fruits!

2
00:00:03.985 --> 00:00:11.435
Hello, hello! Hello, hello! Wave your hand, and say hello! Hello!

3
00:00:12.410 --> 00:00:13.851
Coco, look at the market!

4
00:00:13.901 --> 00:00:16.420
So many fruits! Let's learn!

5
00:00:17.901 --> 00:00:21.468
Orange! Say it with me. Orange!

6
00:00:25.482 --> 00:00:29.249
Mango! Say it with me. Mango!

7
00:00:33.235 --> 00:00:36.601
Grapes! Say it with me. Grapes!

8
00:00:40.635 --> 00:00:44.484
Watermelon! Say it with me. Watermelon!

9
00:00:48.414 --> 00:00:51.397
Sweet! Say it with me. Sweet!

10
00:00:55.381 --> 00:00:58.881
Juice! Say it with me. Juice!

11
00:01:02.913 --> 00:01:05.620
I like mangoes! Sweet, sweet mangoes!

12
00:01:05.670 --> 00:01:12.880
I like grapes! What fruit do you like?

13
00:01:12.930 --> 00:01:14.080
Yummy!

14
00:01:15.048 --> 00:01:19.711
The watermelon is…

15
00:01:19.761 --> 00:01:20.911
Big!

16
00:01:21.726 --> 00:01:25.143
Let's count. One, two, three!

17
00:01:28.158 --> 00:01:34.708
This is N. N is for nose. Nose! N is for nest. Nest!

18
00:01:38.759 --> 00:01:45.922
Bye-bye, bye-bye! See you soon! Wave your hand. Bye-bye, bye-bye!

19
00:01:45.972 --> 00:01:47.534
Bye-bye, friends!

